    "role": "student",
    "text": "The teaser is not really supposed to talk about the proposed work (that's for chapter 2, approach). Simply remove the statements about it and lead better into your research question.\nThere probably are papers that point out how a more physical form makes it easier for customers to engage with the agent, which would be great to lead into your research question as a logical conclusion from pointing this out.",
